WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.378 --> 00:00:03.878
(sentimental piano music)

00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:07.053
- [Narrator] Every year in Haifa,

00:00:07.053 --> 00:00:09.409
Israel, a beauty pageant is held.

00:00:09.409 --> 00:00:12.421
But the contestants
aren't what you'd expect.

00:00:12.421 --> 00:00:15.421
Each is a survivor of the Holocaust.

00:00:46.999 --> 00:00:49.362
- [Narrator] But this isn't
a traditional beauty pageant.

00:00:49.362 --> 00:00:52.613
Judges consider contestants'
personal stories of survival

00:00:52.613 --> 00:00:54.394
and how each has rebuilt their lives

00:00:54.394 --> 00:00:58.561
and contributed to their
communities since the war.

00:01:15.847 --> 00:01:17.815
- [Narrator] Rita was born in Romania.

00:01:17.815 --> 00:01:20.588
In 1942, when she was nine years old,

00:01:20.588 --> 00:01:22.364
Nazi soldiers came to her house

00:01:22.364 --> 00:01:26.531
and took her father away to be
sent to a concentration camp.

00:01:47.679 --> 00:01:49.041
- [Narrator] Rita's father escaped

00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.636
and survived the war,
but he was badly injured.

00:01:51.636 --> 00:01:53.272
The family was eventually reunited

00:01:53.272 --> 00:01:57.188
but he never fully recovered
and died just four years later.

00:01:57.188 --> 00:01:58.983
Shortly after her father's death,

00:01:58.983 --> 00:02:00.892
Rita and her mother sought a fresh start

00:02:00.892 --> 00:02:04.059
in the newly-formed country of Israel.

00:02:48.926 --> 00:02:50.229
- [Narrator] Since its inception,

00:02:50.229 --> 00:02:52.268
the pageant has been controversial.

00:02:52.268 --> 00:02:54.326
Some critics claim it sensationalizes

00:02:54.326 --> 00:02:56.486
the suffering of the participants.

00:02:56.486 --> 00:02:59.236
But Rita doesn't see it that way.

00:03:13.661 --> 00:03:16.828
(angelic choir music)

